{"ID":"20240522082242-qc7u0wi","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240522082242-qc7u0wi","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240522082242-qc7u0wi\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240522095710-6asy8k1\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240522095742-i7c88ub\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:935,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240522095742-i7c88ub\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:0\u0026#125;","title":"北辰醫師的肝癌案例","type":"doc","updated":"20240522095742"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240522095710-6asy8k1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095710-6asy8k1","updated":"20240522095710"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肝癌"}]},{"ID":"20240522095710-3e35hya","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095710-3e35hya","updated":"20240522095710"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\t病人 男性 31歲 傳真看診 初診日期 1/15/2009"}]},{"ID":"20240522095710-9g47688","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095710-9g47688","updated":"20240522095710"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"   病人於2008年被醫院診斷為肝癌, 驚恐之下, 立即做了肝的部份切除及化療, 術後極度不適, 來診時睡眠差, 每日半夜一點準時醒來, 醒後肝區及腹部疼痛, 徹夜不眠, 大便一日3次不成形, 小便一日7,8次, 淡黃味重, 胃口差, 食不下, 味覺差, 受風時肚子絞痛, 手溫足冷, 夜間身熱, 怕風怕冷, 口不渴, 極喜熱飲, 體力極差, 整日疲勞."}]},{"ID":"20240522095710-ozdoiid","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095710-ozdoiid","updated":"20240522095710"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"舌脈未見."}]},{"ID":"20240522095710-ktmaqge","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095710-ktmaqge","updated":"20240522095710"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"   我判斷此人肝區疼痛是術後瘀血阻滯, 受風腹部疼痛是寒積, 胃口差, 食不下, 是肝木克脾土, 同時胰臟虛弱故味覺差, 足冷且怕風怕冷是里有寒積, 夜間身熱為陽不入陰, 陰實仍在, 診斷為肝家陰實之症, 陽不入陰, 里寒."}]},{"ID":"20240522095710-jylqfas","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095710-jylqfas","updated":"20240522095725"}},{"ID":"20240522095710-nxyi47j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095710-nxyi47j","updated":"20240522095710"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"方用四逆湯和小建中湯加減"}]},{"ID":"20240522095710-jcqgvph","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095710-jcqgvph","updated":"20240522095710"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生附子三錢 乾薑三錢 炙甘草三錢-----四逆湯去里寒攻陰實"}]},{"ID":"20240522095710-k24iqna","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095710-k24iqna","updated":"20240522095710"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"柴胡三錢 xx三錢 xxx三錢-----清肝活血軟堅"}]},{"ID":"20240522095710-nrr0bg2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095710-nrr0bg2","updated":"20240522095710"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"桂枝三錢 白芍六錢 生姜二片 紅棗十枚-----小建中湯去腹部寒痛兼實脾"}]},{"ID":"20240522095710-dy167i3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095710-dy167i3","updated":"20240522095710"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"三七三錢 續斷三錢-----活血化瘀"}]},{"ID":"20240522095710-k8xq8hy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095710-k8xq8hy","updated":"20240522095710"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"當歸三錢 川芎五錢------活血補血"}]},{"ID":"20240522095710-rbmycg6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095710-rbmycg6","updated":"20240522095710"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"xxx三錢------壯命門火兼去里寒"}]},{"ID":"20240522095710-usymu2s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095710-usymu2s","updated":"20240522095710"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"服食加一匙麥芽糖沖服"}]},{"ID":"20240522095710-0esqcs9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095710-0esqcs9","updated":"20240522095710"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"五劑"}]},{"ID":"20240522095710-j2zk3sj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095710-j2zk3sj","updated":"20240522095710"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"　"}]},{"ID":"20240522095710-g7y2xnk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095710-g7y2xnk","updated":"20240522095710"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"   2/17日回診報告, 服藥後手足溫, 睡眠開始好轉, 上半夜好, 下半夜差, 肚子不痛了, 大便每日1-2次, 略成形, 極臭, 小便淡黃正常, 胃口仍小, 但肚子及肝區不痛了, 早晨有陽舉了, 開始鼻塞流清涕."}]},{"ID":"20240522095710-fu6cpc6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095710-fu6cpc6","updated":"20240522095710"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"病人情況開始好轉, 鼻塞流清涕是里寒外出之象, 繼續服用原方拾付."}]},{"ID":"20240522095710-cqpvxxq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095710-cqpvxxq","updated":"20240522095710"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3/9回診報告, 胃口開始好轉, 睡眠可睡5-6小時, 半夜3-4點醒, 一小時後睡回, 仍流清涕. 其餘皆好."}]},{"ID":"20240522095710-pn4c71g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095710-pn4c71g","updated":"20240522095710"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"病人夜間仍醒, 且在肺經時間, 可見肺中有寒氣梗阻, 原方加細辛二錢 辛夷花三錢 蒼朮三錢 石菖蒲三錢再拾付."}]},{"ID":"20240522095710-uhu7bw6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095710-uhu7bw6","updated":"20240522095710"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"之後病人回診持續好轉, 中間加入生半夏三錢, 茯苓四錢 繼續去除肺中寒水, 加柏子仁通便助眠, 一直服用到七月."}]},{"ID":"20240522095710-diftlwu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095710-diftlwu","updated":"20240522095710"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"   7/30回診病人非常高興, 因為自我感覺非常好, 手足溫熱, 睡眠一覺到天亮, 夜間無身熱, 大便1-2次成形, 小便7-8次淡黃, 胃口好, 吃飯香, 精力旺盛, 對生活充滿希望."}]},{"ID":"20240522095710-vloxw5n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095710-vloxw5n","updated":"20240522095710"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"基本上, 從此以後只要病人調養得宜, 飲食正常, 作息規律, 保持倪師說的六大狀態正常, 癌症已經不會再威脅這位病人了."}]},{"ID":"20240522095710-s5f37pm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095710-s5f37pm","updated":"20240522095710"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"學生北辰報告到此"}]},{"ID":"20240522095710-7whfuf6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095710-7whfuf6","updated":"20240522095710"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"　"}]},{"ID":"20240522095710-4mgvd8j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095710-4mgvd8j","updated":"20240522095740"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"老師評語"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522095710-95h15my","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095710-95h15my","updated":"20240522095710"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"  北辰是我的優秀學生之一，讀者看到他處理的案例就應該可以知道，世間已經很少中醫師可以做出這種對肝癌病人的處理方式，不但思考細膩，面面俱到之外，還大膽用藥， 藥簡力專，沒有使用一味多餘的藥物，這就是這個案例會成功的地方了，希望同學多多效法你們北辰師兄的治療與思維模式。"}]},{"ID":"20240522095710-g4718pm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095710-g4718pm","updated":"20240522095710"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"漢唐中醫 倪海廈 謹記於佛州2009年08月03日"}]},{"ID":"20240522095740-6bwcfjz","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240522095740-6bwcfjz"}},{"ID":"20240522095742-i7c88ub","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095742-i7c88ub"}}]}